[A.]
<h2>Tournament Begins</h2>
<i>"I am not crazy, for I do indeed know what I am doing"<br>
--Psychotic High Priest</i>  
<p>
The Furies decide to add you to the tournament, along with another High Priest of Nimbus.  There is one rule - NO ALLIES!  Only one problem, after you were added they changed the rules.  Is it everyone for themselves?  Wait and see as the Tournament Begins.

